<Slide notes={`这里的并行关系要看清。最左边是输入包：候选、材料、校验报告，必要时再附一份待审查的方案说明，而且它先经过了本地校验。

中间两个审阅角色并列。资料核对员看约束、来源和缺口，表达审查员看表述和证据对不对得上。它们拿到的是同一份材料，但各自的指令、上下文和输出文件独立，所以能同时开始，不用互相等。

两份审阅都交回来，才进入汇总，由汇总员生成 team-report.md。

下面那条是失败边界：某个审阅在请求或响应处理环节没完成，就中止本次汇总。注意这是执行失败，不是审查员发现了业务问题——正常返回的批评意见反而应该进入汇总。整条成功路线固定三次模型调用。`} style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', flexDirection: 'column', padding: '20px 64px' }}>

    <Box style={{ height: 100, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 20 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 44, background: '#276FBF' }} />
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779' }}>2.12.1　先判断是否值得拆分</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#20344B' }}>两个并行审阅，一次统一汇总</Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 540, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 14 }}>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 3, height: 24, background: '#276FBF' }} />
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#546779' }}>同一输入包，独立调用；汇总必须等待两份审阅</Text>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>

            <Box style={{ width: 300, height: 260, background: '#EDF4FC', borderRadius: 8, padding: '16px 18px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 8, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#276FBF' }}>输入包</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>先通过本地校验{'\n'}同一候选、材料{'\n'}与校验报告</Text>
                <Box style={{ height: 1, background: '#B5C7D8' }} />
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>可附待审查的{'\n'}方案说明</Text>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ width: 44, height: 260, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 26, color: '#276FBF' }}>›</Text></Box>

            <Box style={{ width: 340, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 12 }}>
                <Box style={{ width: 340, height: 124, background: '#EDF4FC', borderRadius: 8, padding: '14px 16px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#276FBF' }}>资料核对员</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>检查约束、来源与缺口{'\n'}独立调用，可与右侧并行</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ width: 340, height: 124, background: '#EDF4FC', borderRadius: 8, padding: '14px 16px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#276FBF' }}>表达审查员</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>检查表述与证据是否相符{'\n'}独立调用，可与左侧并行</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ width: 44, height: 260, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 26, color: '#26816B' }}>›</Text></Box>

            <Box style={{ width: 300, height: 260, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 12 }}>
                <Box style={{ width: 300, height: 72, background: '#F4F7FA', borderRadius: 8, padding: '12px 16px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#20344B' }}>等待两份审阅</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779' }}>各自上下文、各自输出文件</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ width: 300, height: 28, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#26816B' }}>↓</Text></Box>
                <Box style={{ width: 300, height: 136, background: '#ECF7F2', borderRadius: 8, padding: '14px 16px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#26816B' }}>汇总员</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>两份审阅均完成{'\n'}才返回并汇总{'\n'}生成 team-report.md</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>

        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 16 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 700, height: 60, background: '#FFF4E6', borderRadius: 8, padding: '10px 18px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 3, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#CB6B28' }}>任一审阅执行失败　→　中止本次汇总</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779' }}>指请求、响应处理未完成，不是审查员发现了业务问题</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, height: 60, background: '#EDF4FC', borderRadius: 8, padding: '10px 18px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 3, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#276FBF' }}>完整成功路线</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779' }}>固定三次模型调用；不动态扩张团队，不并写同一候选文件</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779' }}>2.12 多 Agent 协作与工作流</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779' }}>05 / 25</Text>
    </Box>

</Slide>
